WEBVTT

00:03:59.389 --> 00:04:01.150
Meqe ra fjala, Dalai Lama

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:03.270
eshte dikush qe eshte plakur me hijeshi,

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.677
por kush do te jete vegjetarian dhe beqar?

00:04:05.677 --> 00:04:09.261
(Te qeshura)

00:04:12.676 --> 00:04:15.206
Meditimi ndihmon.

00:04:15.206 --> 00:04:19.173
(Video) Femija : Ommm. Ommm. Ommm.

00:04:19.173 --> 00:04:21.110
Isabel Allende: Ommm. Ja ku eshte.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.165
Dhe eshte mire te fillosh sa me heret.

00:04:23.165 --> 00:04:26.836
E dini, per nje femer mendjemadhe si une,

00:04:26.836 --> 00:04:30.233
eshte e veshtire te plakesh ne kete kulture.